  "title": "Cinnamon Oatmeal Zucchini Cookies",
  "description": "This oatmeal cookie recipe boasts a nice cinnamon zing and crunchy pecans, with a bonus point for the zucchini hidden inside. Your kids will never know!",
  "authors": [
    "KitchenQueen"
  ],
